          <p>Lyophilized vials for reconstitution in the lab. Our core format.</p>
          <span class="cat-link">Browse →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/collections/all#f-nasal" class="cat-card">
          <img class="cat-icon" src="{{ 'icon-nasal.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
